// 50 realistic reviews for "Client Satisfaction" section.
// Names, cases, and locations are illustrative; edit as real testimonials come in.
export const REVIEWS=[{n:"Aarav & Zoya",loc:"Inter-faith · Defence Colony, Delhi",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"We were nervous about the notice period but everything went by the book. Every step was explained legally — no shortcuts, no surprises."},{n:"Priya Malhotra",loc:"Hindu Marriage Act · Saket",c:"HMA Registration",q:"Certificate in hand in eight working days. The advocate vetted every document before submission — nothing came back from the SDM office."},{n:"Captain Vikram Singh",loc:"NRI case · USA → Delhi",c:"NRI Marriage",q:"I couldn't fly down for the entire process. Power of Attorney and embassy attestations handled end-to-end. Certificate reached me in Houston."},{n:"Faisal & Mehak",loc:"Inter-faith · Gurugram",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"Frivolous objection was raised during the 30-day notice. The advocate handled the hearing and our registration went through cleanly."},{n:"Rohit Tripathi",loc:"Time-sensitive · Noida",c:"HMA Tatkal",q:"Was told honestly — 'this can be done in 7 days under HMA, not 24 hours'. That truthful advice saved us from agents promising the impossible."},{n:"Aditi & Kabir Arora",loc:"Court marriage · Patiala House",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"Clear written quote upfront, court coordination was tight, witnesses arranged by chamber. Felt like a real law firm, not a service desk."},{n:"Simran Kaur",loc:"Runaway case · Delhi",c:"Protection + SMA",q:"My family did not approve. Protection petition was filed in the High Court and we got police protection the same week. Married peacefully 31 days later."},{n:"Arjun & Nandini",loc:"Inter-caste · Dwarka",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"No one made us feel judged. The process was treated as a civil formality. That respect mattered."},{n:"Dr. Kavya Reddy",loc:"NRI · London",c:"SMA with POA",q:"Handled apostille, embassy attestation, and my UK single-status certificate. The process was coordinated over video calls."},{n:"Yusuf & Anisha",loc:"Inter-faith · Okhla",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"We were worried about religious complications. Under SMA, none of it mattered — only our consent and documents did."},{n:"Priyanka Sen",loc:"Duplicate certificate · East Delhi",c:"Certificate Service",q:"Lost our original certificate before a visa interview. Got a certified duplicate from Karkardooma in four days."},{n:"Rahul & Tanya",loc:"Gurugram",c:"HMA Registration",q:"Fees quoted on day one matched the final invoice to the rupee. Transparent pricing, as promised."},{n:"Ahmed Siddiqui",loc:"Faridabad",c:"SMA Registration",q:"Muslim couple, civil marriage route. No pressure to register under personal law. Entirely our choice."},{n:"Shruti & Devansh",loc:"Ghaziabad",c:"HMA Registration",q:"Complete clarity on jurisdiction. Turned out the Ghaziabad Collectorate was correct — not Noida — and that saved us weeks."},{n:"Aman Gupta",loc:"NRI (Canada)",c:"NRI Marriage",q:"Single-status certificate from Toronto, apostille, and Delhi filing coordinated in parallel. 47-day turnaround for an NRI case is excellent."},{n:"Meera Pillai",loc:"South Delhi",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"Christian–Hindu marriage under SMA. The chamber was deeply respectful of both of our families' concerns."},{n:"Vishal & Radhika",loc:"Patiala House",c:"Court Marriage",q:"The Marriage Officer knew us by name by the time we appeared. That's the kind of pre-coordination that matters."},{n:"Harpreet Singh",loc:"Rohini, Delhi",c:"HMA Registration",q:"Sikh couple, registered under HMA. Simple, quick, and the certificate format was accepted by the US embassy first try."},{n:"Ankita & Nishant",loc:"Inter-caste · Noida",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"Families came around over the 30 days. By solemnisation day, they attended. Grateful for the advocate's patience."},{n:"Lt. Cdr. R. Menon",loc:"Navy · Kochi → Delhi",c:"Tatkal HMA",q:"Had to marry and sail within three weeks. HMA registration in six days made it possible — without bending a rule."},{n:"Fatima & Imran",loc:"Okhla",c:"SMA Registration",q:"Our nikah was already done. Got it registered under SMA for legal record and future visa needs."},{n:"Kunal Bajaj",loc:"Saket, Delhi",c:"Name correction",q:"Spelling mismatch between passport and certificate was blocking my wife's dependent visa. Corrected in eleven days."},{n:"Neha & Ritesh",loc:"Greater Noida",c:"HMA Registration",q:"Ours was the first case at the Surajpur complex that the advocate handled — the jurisdictional guidance was crystal clear."},{n:"Zara & Dhruv",loc:"Inter-faith · Gurugram",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"The most thoughtful handling of two very different family expectations. Professional from day one to day forty-five."},{n:"Anonymous (on request)",loc:"Protection case · Delhi",c:"Protection Petition",q:"I cannot share my name but I owe this chamber for being married today instead of trapped. Police protection order arrived within 72 hours."},{n:"Sanjana Iyer",loc:"NRI · Dubai",c:"NRI Marriage",q:"Dubai single-status certificate, Indian visa, embassy attestation — every thread traced and tied. Calm, senior handling."},{n:"Prateek & Ishita",loc:"Dwarka",c:"Court Marriage",q:"Zero delays. Notice filed on day one, solemnised on day thirty-two. Three witnesses arranged by the chamber."},{n:"Dr. Arindam Bose",loc:"East Delhi",c:"HMA Registration",q:"Bengali couple. The advocate walked us through the wedding photographs and invitation card requirements properly."},{n:"Tanvi & Aditya",loc:"Noida",c:"SMA Registration",q:"We'd already had a temple ceremony but preferred SMA for official record. Registered without issue at Sector 33."},{n:"Rakesh Yadav",loc:"Ballabhgarh, Faridabad",c:"HMA Registration",q:"Haryana rules differ slightly. The chamber knew them well and filed correctly first time."},{n:"Isha & Kabir",loc:"Inter-religious · Lajpat Nagar",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"At no point were we asked to 'convert for convenience'. SMA exists for a reason and was used correctly."},{n:"Brig. (Retd.) J. Malhotra",loc:"For daughter · Patiala House",c:"Court Marriage",q:"Accompanied my daughter through the process. Meticulous, courteous, and procedurally correct."},{n:"Aarushi & Rehan",loc:"Inter-faith · Noida",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"The clarity about the 30-day notice removed every anxiety. No one tried to sell us a faster 'magic' route."},{n:"Dev & Payal",loc:"Ghaziabad",c:"HMA Registration",q:"Collectorate case. Documentation was watertight — our registrar commented on it during verification."},{n:"Rohini Kapoor",loc:"NRI · Singapore",c:"NRI Marriage",q:"Balanced the Singapore ROM requirements alongside Indian SMA registration. Both certificates, both jurisdictions recognised."},{n:"Arjun & Mira",loc:"Connaught Place, Delhi",c:"Court Marriage",q:"Corporate timelines meant we needed predictability. We got it — to the day."},{n:"Saurabh Pandey",loc:"Protection petition · Delhi HC",c:"Protection Case",q:"Filed under Article 226. Protection order granted, SMA notice filed the next week. The chamber was available every time I panicked."},{n:"Kriti & Jai",loc:"Gurugram",c:"HMA Registration",q:"Fees were not the cheapest. They were the fairest. We got real value for what we paid."},{n:"Sara Thomas",loc:"Kerala → Delhi",c:"SMA Registration",q:"Christian–Hindu couple. Treated with dignity. Absolutely zero religious commentary from anyone."},{n:"Abhishek & Kanika",loc:"Noida",c:"Court Marriage",q:"We had a minor document mismatch. It was fixed through a proper affidavit — not hidden under a carpet."},{n:"Col. R. Sharma",loc:"For son · Delhi",c:"Court Marriage",q:"Old-school in my preference for legal rigour. The chamber didn't cut a single corner. Impressed."},{n:"Nishi & Aryan",loc:"Faridabad",c:"HMA Registration",q:"Friendly but formal — exactly the balance I wanted for something this important."},{n:"Rishabh Mehta",loc:"Rohini",c:"Duplicate Certificate",q:"Original misplaced during shifting. Duplicate certificate retrieved from SDM records and apostilled for UAE in two weeks."},{n:"Anjali & Umang",loc:"Inter-caste · Noida",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"Our biggest fear was objections during notice. Handled cleanly. Solemnised on day 31."},{n:"Pallavi Jain",loc:"NRI · Australia",c:"NRI Marriage",q:"Registered under HMA while my husband was in Melbourne. Embassy attestation after issuance was seamless."},{n:"Mohammed & Zeenat",loc:"Okhla, Delhi",c:"Nikah + SMA Registration",q:"Nikah performed separately. Civil registration for legal record handled under SMA — no contradiction, both valid."},{n:"Diksha & Rohit",loc:"Saket",c:"Court Marriage",q:"Friendly chamber. Detailed explanations. They never made us feel we were asking 'silly' questions."},{n:"Vibhor Chopra",loc:"Dwarka",c:"HMA Registration",q:"We chose the chamber over three cheaper quotes. Still the best money we spent in the entire process."},{n:"Ananya & Zeeshan",loc:"Inter-faith · Greater Noida",c:"Special Marriage Act",q:"Parents initially refused. Forty-five days later, they walked us into the SDM office. Grateful beyond words."},{n:"Siddharth & Alisha",loc:"Patiala House Courts",c:"Court Marriage",q:"Senior advocate personally appeared on solemnisation day. That level of seriousness is hard to find now."}];
